<section class="auth-card"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="owner-brand-symbol"><%- include('../components/brand-symbol') %></span>StockChief</a><p class="eyebrow">Private platform owner console</p><h1>Run your SaaS business.</h1><p>Sign in here to manage StockChief and answer customer conversations. No inventory-app sign-in is needed.</p><form method="post" action="/login"><input type="hidden" name="returnTo" value="<%= locals.returnTo||'/' %>"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label>Owner email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="username" required autofocus></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></label><button class="primary">Continue to MFA</button></form><small>Restricted to explicitly authorized platform operators. Customer accounts cannot enter this console.</small></section>
